# Kod 9930 — Sensor Panel (ayri proje)

**9928** = GPS web dashboard. **9930** = fiziksel sensor panel — **ayni UART, ayni anda calismaz**.

## Deploy

```bat
cd C:\Users\oalpe\Desktop\neo_gps\sensor_panel
9930.bat
```

## Kartta tek calistirma

```bash
bash ~/sensor_panel/start.sh
# veya: sudo python3 ~/sensor_panel/panel.py
```

## Bitstream

`gps_i2c.bin` (combo UART + I2C) — `/home/xilinx/sensor_panel/`

## Servis

`neo-sensor-panel.service` — acilista otomatik. GPS web icin 9928 kullan (neo-gps servisi).
